    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>A Kwik Delivery integration for Woocommerce, including real time shipping rates, order scheduling and tracking updates.</p>\n<h3>Capabilities of the Kwik Delivery Integration</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Real Time Shipping Calculation</li>\n<li>Schedule Order on Successful Payments</li>\n<li>Track Order Updates</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Login to your wordpress site as an “admin user” and follow the steps below.</p>\n<p>1) First on your wordpress admin dashboard and install this plugin and activate it.</p>\n<p>2) Go to Woocommerce Settings Page &gt; Shipping Tab</p>\n<p>3) Click the Sub Tab &#8220;Kwik Delivery&#8221;.</p>\n<p>4) Go to your Kwik Delivery account and get your username and password.</p>\n<p>5) Copy and paste the keys into your Kwik Delivery Shipping settings.</p>\n<p>6) Fill up other neccessary settings.</p>\n<p>7) Save all settings.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<p>versin 1.2.1<br />\nChange payment method for all other type except ccod.</p>\n"
    },
